{
  "_about": "The sports park's designed ground (docs/runbooks/sportsPark.md, docs/DECALS-PLAYBOOK.md): the community park built on a 220 x 200 site, its library instances waited for (instances, variants, GPU memory in the log), frame times before the build, with the ground drawn and with it switched off, then the whole site from 45 degrees and close looks at leaves, a worn path edge, a goalmouth, a puddle, kerb grime and a fence line. Send with: powershell -File tools/suite/Send-Suite.ps1 -File suite/scenarios/ground-sports.json -Who sports-ground",
